`e`\ndetermines the value of `a`. Unlike `isEmbeddingApp?`, chains such as `a.toBitVec.toNat` are\nnot collapsed; callers resolve them one step at a time.","docLink":"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Arith/Cutsat/Model.html#Lean.Meta.Grind.Arith.Cutsat.embeddingArg?","kind":"def","line":31,"name":"Lean.Meta.Grind.Arith.Cutsat.embeddingArg?","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/0b77e12952ad39077d80d8bd6b66d601f225c321/src/Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Arith/Cutsat/Model.lean#L31-L52"}}],"imports":["Lean.Meta.Tactic.Grind.Arith.Cutsat.Types","Lean.Meta.Tactic.Grind.Arith.ModelUtil"],"instances":[],"name":"Lean.Meta.Tactic.Grind.Arith.Cutsat.Model"}